{"seq":36,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l3-mu-v04-dev/rr-09-l3-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T00:31:46.767Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e6e601912d76960fdb89d534e1ee87249c3745ac3a2ab2eb7020319c0fe64f40","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"Hi Pree, here's what I could find on both:\n\n*Driver SMS prompt glitch on overflow lots: ticket #4412.* This comes from Moss's Central handoff digest dated 2 Jan 2026. Hollis flagged it as one of two open tickets on your dealer account before Marrow Fieldworks changed hands on Mon 5 Jan 2026. The digest calls it a minor driver SMS prompt glitch when combine trailers are staged on unpaved overflow lots. The other ticket was #4409, a recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at Salina North (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake). I found nothing after that, so I can't tell you whether #4412 was resolved.\n\n*West yard Door 2 double-booking: ticket #8841.* Tobias mentioned this in #central-random on 13 Oct. He'd checked the Plains depots on \"Tobias's dealer account\" and said West yard Door 2 is still double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk. He flagged it to support on #8841. That came up while Hollis was asking whether the webhook patch had fixed the tractor-bay alerts. I found no later update.\n\nOne thing to check: neither message actually names Marrow Fieldworks as \"Tobias's dealer account.\" I'm assuming it is because of the January handoff, so it's worth confirming with Tobias before you put #8841 in the file. I also didn't find any ticket files for the account in the share.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000127"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792591200.000128","thread_ts":"1792591200.000127"}}
{"seq":37,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l3-mu-v04-dev/rr-09-l3-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T00:31:46.881Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"2555c2f748e7c6ead399f52286a5c3004ac8dc7d3ee536b699fd4ffeb5fe5299","actor":null,"via":"runner","tool":"gbrain.ingest","kind":"admin","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792591200.000128","author":"assistant","source":"private-pree-sundaram"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"fact_id":"6","source":"private-pree-sundaram","latency_ms":114,"status":"inserted"}}
{"seq":38,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l3-mu-v04-dev/rr-09-l3-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T00:31:53.360Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"27dcaa89ecb7559c66553765c5d00a2d3aacc27aac350d428101007d55908a43","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"I've replied to Pree in our DM, in a thread on her message. I only used sources she can see herself: #central-team, #central-random, our DM and public files.\n\n**Driver SMS prompt glitch on overflow lots: ticket #4412.**\n- **Source:** Moss's Central handoff note dated 2 Jan 2026. Hollis flagged #4412 as one of two open tickets on Pree's dealer account before Marrow Fieldworks changed hands on Mon 5 Jan 2026.\n- **What it is:** the note calls it a minor driver SMS prompt glitch when combine trailers are parked on unpaved overflow lots.\n- **The other ticket:** #4409, a recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at Salina North (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake).\n- **Status:** I found nothing after that note, so I couldn't say whether #4412 was fixed.\n\n**West yard Door 2 double-booking: ticket #8841.**\n- **Source:** Tobias in #central-random on 13 Oct. He'd checked the Plains depots on \"Tobias's dealer account\" and said Door 2 still double-books when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk. He flagged it to support on #8841.\n- **Status:** I found no later update.\n\n**Not confirmed:** nothing I found says Marrow Fieldworks is \"Tobias's dealer account.\" I'm guessing it is because of the January handoff. I suggested Pree check with Tobias before adding #8841 to the Marrow Fieldworks file. There are also no ticket files for the account in the shared files.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000127"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792591200.000129","thread_ts":"1792591200.000127"}}
